    <item>AMOLED interface</item>
    <item>Cookies stay in encrypted private storage and are excluded from diagnostics. Saving cookies does not prove that the session is valid.</item>
    <item>Select your .thumbnails folder for local photos. Optional retrieval is managed separately in Thumbnail Fetcher.</item>
    <item>Each WebView has its own start-to-start delay. A waiting worker does not block other ready workers. Server cooldown and access restrictions apply to the whole pool. Batch work follows these hours, including overnight windows. Viewer requests take priority after active operations finish and still obey delays and access restrictions. Android may delay background work.</item>
    <item>If Android requests permission, confirm the same folder already selected in Profile Images. No second output folder is used.</item>
    <item>Clearing the index or image cache never deletes your photos or collections. Rescan only reads source files and preserves orphan thumbnails. The optional fetcher writes only validated profile thumbnails.</item>
    <item>Folder changes are recognized when you select Rescan Thumbnails. If permission or access is lost, select the folder again.</item>
